 "Platform Rise (Failed)": "平台升起（失败）",
 "Plays 6 dB louder than the ship music after it, and replacements are unreliable. To skip it, use silence with Move straight on.": "播放时比之后的舰船音乐响 6 dB，且替换效果不稳定。要跳过它，请使用静音并让游戏直接继续。",
 "Plays after the drop location screen and continues from where that music left off, in loops #1 to #14. The start segment plays only when the loadout screen opens straight from the ship.": "在空降地点界面之后播放，并从该音乐停下的位置继续，循环 #1 到 #14。只有直接从舰船打开配装界面时才播放开始段落。",
 "Plays after the drop location screen and continues from where that music left off, in loops #1–14. The start segment plays only when the loadout screen opens straight from the ship.": "在空降地点界面之后播放，并从该音乐停下的位置继续，循环 #1–14。只有直接从舰船打开配装界面时才播放开始段落。",
 "Plays after the pelican takes off, into the mission results (music_extraction_takeoff).": "鹈鹕起飞后播放，一直持续到任务结算（music_extraction_takeoff）。",
 "Plays as the hellpod lands, leading into the mission music (also called 'Hellpod Land Cue').": "地狱舱着陆时播放，并引入任务音乐（又称“地狱舱着陆乐段”）。",
 "Plays as the pelican takes off.": "鹈鹕起飞时播放。",
 "Plays at the highest combat intensity.": "在最高战斗强度时播放。",
 "Plays during a fight, also called common battle.": "战斗中播放，又称普通战斗。",
 "Plays from calling the pelican until it lands. It has an intro, then two blocks of six segments. Each stem switches between calm and intense audio.": "从呼叫鹈鹕到其着陆期间播放。先是一段开场，然后是两组各六个段落。每个分轨在平静和激烈的音频之间切换。",
 "Plays in gas, and in weather that makes Helldivers cough.": "在毒气中以及会让绝地潜兵咳嗽的天气中播放。",
 "Plays on a respawn in the middle of a fight.": "战斗中途重生时播放。",
 "Plays on death, until the respawn.": "死亡时播放，直到重生。",
 "Plays on dying.": "死亡时播放。",
 "Plays on landing softly.": "轻轻落地时播放。",
 "Plays on taking heavy damage.": "受到严重伤害时播放。",
 "Plays on taking minor damage and on being knocked down.": "受到轻微伤害和被击倒时播放。",
 "Plays on taking moderate damage.": "受到中等伤害时播放。",
 "Plays on the stats screen (music_stats_screen).": "在统计界面上播放（music_stats_screen）。",
 "Plays once on loading into the ship. There are three intros, one per camera.": "载入舰船时播放一次。共有三段开场，每个镜头一段。",
 "Plays once the pelican has landed and waits.": "鹈鹕着陆并等待时播放。",
 "Plays over the bridge music when the destroyer jumps to another system (also called 'warping to a system').": "驱逐舰跃迁到其他星系时，叠加在舰桥音乐之上播放（又称“跃迁到星系”）。",
 "Plays when a main objective is completed.": "完成主要目标时播放。",
 "Plays when a mission fails (music_mission_failure). The same audio plays for every enemy faction, at the end of the mission and on the stats screen.": "任务失败时播放（music_mission_failure）。所有敌方阵营都播放相同的音频，在任务结束时和统计界面上都会播放。",
 "Plays when a secondary objective or outpost is done, at low intensity only. During a fight the combat music keeps going.": "完成次要目标或清除前哨站时播放，仅限低强度时。战斗中则继续播放战斗音乐。",
 "Plays when approaching an outpost.": "接近前哨站时播放。",
 "Plays when diving and landing.": "飞扑和落地时播放。",
 "Plays when enemies spot the squad and engage.": "敌人发现小队并交战时播放。",
 "Plays when few enemies are left, or when leaving a fight.": "敌人所剩无几或脱离战斗时播放。",
 "Plays when few enemies are left, or when leaving a fight. May also play on death.": "敌人所剩无几或脱离战斗时播放。死亡时也可能播放。",
 "Plays when leaving the water after nearly drowning.": "险些溺水后离开水面时播放。",
 "Plays when lifting the locks of a missile silo hatch.": "解开导弹发射井舱门锁时播放。",
 "Plays when the flames on a Helldiver go out.": "绝地潜兵身上的火焰熄灭时播放。",
 "Plays when throwing a grenade.": "投掷手雷时播放。",
 "Plays when throwing something heavy, such as an artillery shell.": "投掷重物（如炮弹）时播放。",
 "Plays when vaulting over an obstacle.": "翻越障碍物时播放。",
 "Plays when walking on a broken leg or aiming with a broken arm.": "腿部骨折时行走或手臂骨折时瞄准时播放。",
 "Plays while a Helldiver bleeds out from a chest wound.": "绝地潜兵因胸部受伤失血时播放。",
 "Plays while a Helldiver drowns.": "绝地潜兵溺水时播放。",
 "Plays while climbing.": "攀爬时播放。",
 "Plays while crawling.": "匍匐时播放。",
 "Plays while fighting undetected, or while enemies search.": "未被发现时战斗，或敌人搜索时播放。",
 "Plays while no enemies are engaging. The part depends on the intensity: stealth (fighting undetected, or enemies searching), calm (approaching an outpost) and calm transition.": "没有敌人交战时播放。播放的部分取决于强度：潜行（未被发现时战斗，或敌人正在搜索）、平静（接近前哨站）和平静过渡。",
 "Plays while the hellpod falls to the planet.": "地狱舱落向星球时播放。",
 "Plays with a melee attack.": "近战攻击时播放。",
 "Plays with no danger nearby, possibly when distant enemies give chase.": "附近没有危险时播放，可能是远处的敌人开始追击时。",
 "Plays with the This Is Democracy emote.": "随“这就是民主”表情动作播放。",
